  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to enhance trafficking prevention by promoting, popularizing and increasing the use by young people of available resources, governmental and non-governmental organisations, hotlines, helplines, employment centres and all the other legitimate resources available. The focus of the initiative will be a public service announcement campagain, adverts and an Event tour.</narrative>
